      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree e5a4f4b13237578245d571c721db02e18913a210\nparent ed7dd7cf4e1561a97edf72eba29a67b14e28c717\nauthor Shadow <146137079+0xShadowX@users.noreply.github.com> 1791406128 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791406128 -0300\n\nnode: don't abort on invalid -dbcache in settings.json\n\nLogOversizedDbCache is noexcept, but it reads -dbcache through\nGetIntArg, which throws when settings.json holds a number that is not\nan integer or doesn't fit in int64 (e.g. {\"dbcache\": 4096.5}). The\nexception hits the noexcept boundary and std::terminate aborts\nbitcoind during startup.\n\nRemove noexcept so the exception reaches AppInit like it does for other\ninteger settings, and the node exits with an error message instead of\naborting.",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxrAwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/LcQABQWHVilWZoUq92FH47/RHGv\npo4myBMl0raIh60PkuThLdKkFMzjau4PKCDwpuTCtLW9hm6TS12DW/xhzsDS0nL/\nrVU87dfraVh6Cx7IKOBcYTyhYnOzafhsirrr4rPeZqiT/g29KAAov/lNaP4MNCr9\nODuWAJC49hRb+beZ3KerILmLZ5DAjrDsR1rr5Kv373PZMrJR7QpnYKKg2MSmW5V/\njjTkBJag9V+DrxMM1dvBTlOELMB5t9NWk86OmM6PTtkOc+hJM1rQZ7yWVrbvv6I3\nZt0n46O+zTDHVjCxUX/1Oxztk8n5GcFhXA/2rgfyqGriFFVGob6qoZMi3mnZIXdi\nQHV13aNag5jwK6qQWm2KmxbMQHqoyTvXSk7lnM+VV8M+Qq6UXFeh4kUKuFIUkhJj\n1ILs/6/FzZxjO9bPIO8j2ZdFJ1rGxDRh9ElSQaiUoD7h7q3cdH4hukBsQsY4Abad\n+1SWIx50trevnqA5xj90cXJUouIeDR2YupoJ/m/Tn/t7mIlBPfnoQkoH/qTclGv0\nSPWQ2vRpy8JxVyuXa9ymqVwtdtrEah1vzGxD9xk9K1oDS80JiybfiKybGPzLYrwf\nqnv8+NZz4xmXS9kDzBu9CI9Li7m4OWBQPX5CDTmPq3VRCTNfdIMCvOIjG7M4MY9b\nS2gIZZ4jbP1ZJ2GCyJ5j\n=NJjZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n"
