          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/commits/ed7dd7cf4e1561a97edf72eba29a67b14e28c717",
          "sha": "ed7dd7cf4e1561a97edf72eba29a67b14e28c717",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/ed7dd7cf4e1561a97edf72eba29a67b14e28c717"
        }
      ],
      "message": "node: don't abort on invalid -dbcache in settings.json\n\nLogOversizedDbCache is noexcept, but it reads -dbcache through\nGetIntArg, which throws when settings.json holds a number that is not\nan integer or doesn't fit in int64 (e.g. {\"dbcache\": 4096.5}). The\nexception hits the noexcept boundary and std::terminate aborts\nbitcoind during startup.\n\nRemove noexcept so the exception reaches AppInit like it does for other\ninteger settings, and the node exits with an error message instead of\naborting.",
